OL,3,GNEWSA'Whole nation behind you' - Nessa 
OL,4,Adelivers rallying cry for Wales rugby  
OL,5,Ateam                                   
OL,7,FFresh off their historic victory       
OL,8,Fagainst New Zealand's All Blacks, Gavin
OL,9,Fand Stacey's Nessa Jenkins has         
OL,10,Fdelivered a rousing message for the    
OL,11,FWales men's team ahead of Saturday's   
OL,12,Fgame against Australia.                
OL,14,FThe popular character, played by Ruth  
OL,15,FJones, delivered some straight-talking 
OL,16,Fadvice ahead of the team's Nations     
OL,17,FChampionship fixture, reminding them   
OL,18,Fthat the whole nation is behind them.  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
