OL,3,GNEWSA'Whole nation behind you' - Nessa 
OL,4,Adelivers rallying cry for Wales rugby  
OL,5,Ateam                                   
OL,7,F"Oh what's occurin'? The question was  
OL,8,Frhetorical we all know what's          
OL,9,Foccurin'... you are the heroes of      
OL,10,FWales," Nessa said in the video.       
OL,12,FPosted in collaboration with the Welsh 
OL,13,FRugby Union, the caption read: "All    
OL,14,FBlacks? Done. Wallabies? Next up.      
OL,15,FNessa's got a few words of inspiration 
OL,16,Ffor the boys."                         
